                    <annot endid="#m171_k330_003" staff="1 2" startid="#m163_k330_003" type="NMA-note" xml:id="annot_30163_EN" xml:lang="EN">In the autograph the folio with measures 163 to 41 is missing; however, these measures are preserved in the first print edition.</annot>
